        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Back-to-Back Oil Rubbed Bronze Modern Front Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Door Handles with Lock comes with everything you'll need to replace the handle on your front door. It comes packaged as a set that includes a pair of back-to-back mounted pulls and a single cylinder deadbolt. This contemporary 24 inch pull is the perfect length for standard sized doors, making it the ideal choice for entry doors. It can be mounted on wood or metal doors. The oil rubbed bronze finish is rich and chocolatey which makes it beautiful enough for use in any home plus it is tough enough for use in commercial settings too.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SQPULL24A2-specifications.gif?v=1704354621\" width=\"600\" height=\"134\" boarder=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-SQPULL24-8241 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>About the Function:</b> The Single Cylinder Deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior. The Back to Back Mounted Pull attach to one another through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Oil Rubbed Bronze Front Door Pull Set\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike plate</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass Schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 24 Inch Entry Door Pull with Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Pull Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Total Height: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting Centers: 14-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 3-1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-3/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 (two) pulls and a single cylinder deadbolt.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Door Handles with Lock",
                "description": "The Modern Door Handles with Lock comes with everything you'll need to replace the handle on your front door. It comes packaged as a set that includes a pair of back-to-back mounted pulls and a single cylinder deadbolt. This contemporary 24 inch pull is the perfect length for standard sized doors, making it the ideal choice for entry doors. It can be mounted on wood or metal doors. The oil rubbed bronze finish is rich and chocolatey which makes it beautiful enough for use in any home plus it is tough enough for use in commercial settings too.",
